# Migrations are generated — never hand-written

**If you are about to create, edit, or paste SQL into `services/api/migrations/` — STOP.**

## Source of truth

| What | Path | Who edits |
| ---- | ---- | --------- |
| Tables (canonical) | `services/api/schema/sql/schema.sql` | Agents |
| NOTIFY triggers (canonical) | `services/api/schema/sql/realtime_notify.sql` | Agents |
| Generated migrations | `services/api/migrations/*.sql` | **`task schema:diff` only** |

Generation uses [pg-schema-diff](https://github.com/stripe/pg-schema-diff) (`v1.0.7`); runtime apply uses [goose](https://github.com/pressly/goose). See [ADR 0002](../../docs/adr/0002-sql-schema-pg-schema-diff-goose.md).

## Workflow — schema/sql → schema:diff → commit

```bash
# 1. Edit services/api/schema/sql/schema.sql and/or realtime_notify.sql

# 2. Generate migration (from repo root)
task schema:diff -- add_my_column

# 3. Verify
task migrate   # needs DATABASE_URL or ESCALITE_DATABASE_URL

# 4. Commit: schema/sql/*.sql + migrations/<new>.sql
```

`task schema:diff` needs a running Postgres server with existing migrations applied (default: compose dev DB on `127.0.0.1:5432`).

| Mode | Command |
| ---- | ------- |
| No local Postgres | `SCHEMA_DIFF_EPHEMERAL_PG=1 task schema:diff -- <name>` |
| Baseline squash (rare) | `SCHEMA_DIFF_FROM_EMPTY=1 task schema:diff -- bootstrap` |
| Faster local runs | `SCHEMA_DIFF_SKIP_VALIDATION=1 task schema:diff -- <name>` |

**Rename review:** pg-schema-diff may emit `DROP COLUMN` + `ADD COLUMN` for renames. Replace with `ALTER TABLE … RENAME` before committing (see ADR 0002).

## Absolute prohibitions

| Forbidden | Do instead |
| --------- | ---------- |
| Edit `migrations/*.sql` with Write/StrReplace/touch | Workflow above |
| Paste DDL into `migrations/` | Edit `schema.sql` or `realtime_notify.sql` |
| Migration without matching source change | Same commit: canonical SQL + generated migration |
| Hand-edit goose version table | Let `task migrate` manage it |
| `atlas migrate *` / `atlas migrate hash` / `atlas.sum` | Use `task schema:diff` + `task migrate`; apply via `services/dbmigrate` |

## Allowed exceptions

- DML-only backfills in a migration (ADR note required)
- Editing `Taskfile.yml`, `tools/schema-diff/`, `services/api/scripts/schema-*.sh`
- `services/api/queries/*.sql` (sqlc, not schema DDL)
- Manual `RENAME` substitution in a generated migration after review (document in PR)

## Verifier FAIL if

- Agent edited `migrations/*.sql` directly (except approved rename substitution)
- Migration not from `task schema:diff` after canonical SQL change

See `docs/adr/0002-sql-schema-pg-schema-diff-goose.md`.
